## FileVault — Git Ignore

# Build output
bin/
obj/
out/

# VS / Rider IDE
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Local environment secrets — never commit these
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
*.pfx
*.key

# Docker volumes
sqlserver_data/

# Local file storage (runtime uploads)
/storage/

# Test results
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coveragexml

# NuGet
*.nupkg
.nuget/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
